# Whippoorwill's ability on Bot2's Drudge Skeletons: it can't be regenerated this turn (CR 701.19c), damage that would be dealt
# to it this turn can't be prevented (CR 615.12), and when it dies this turn it is exiled (CR 603.7c, 400.7e) - all effects of
# the resolved ability, which outlive Whippoorwill (CR 611.2a). With one green source of two, the ability is refused; Bot1 then
# casts a second Mox Emerald and pays {G}{G} exactly (the pool empty after). Bot1 bolts the Skeletons; in response Bot2 bolts
# Whippoorwill, shields the Skeletons with Healing Salve's "prevent the next 3 damage" and regenerates them. Whippoorwill dies
# first, then the Bolt deals its 3 to the Skeletons anyway, they are destroyed and not regenerated, and they die and are
# exiled from the graveyard.

